@startuml
state "running" as running
state "handoff-required" as handoff
state "conflict-paused" as conflict
state "priority-routed" as priority
[*] --> running : 기본 상태
running --> running : checkpoint_updated
running --> handoff : handoffReason 있음
running --> conflict : 충돌 기록
running --> priority : 우선순위 경로 지정
handoff --> running : 재개·새 시도
conflict --> running : 충돌 해소
priority --> running : 경로 처리 후 재개
note right of running
  유효 상태: running, handoff-required,
  conflict-paused, priority-routed
  JSON 값은 orchestration_state에 저장됨
end note
@enduml
